# Import/Export Plugin REST API Tests
@baseUrl=http://localhost:1337
@contentTypeUid=api::category.category

### 1. List all content types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/import-plugin/content-types

### 2. Get schema for a specific content type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/import-plugin/schema/{{contentTypeUid}}

### 3. Export data to CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/import-plugin/export/{{contentTypeUid}}

### 4. Import data from CSV (multipart/form-data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/import-plugin/import/{{contentTypeUid}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

file < ./sample-import.csv
